    feat(ai-agent): MCP-based closed-loop coding agent (voice + LVGL UI)

    Adopt the MCP-client driven closed loop demoed end-to-end: the on-device
    agent calls remote_ctrl MCP tools to read/write/build/commit/push code,
    with an LVGL chat UI and voice (beep/TTS) feedback. This supersedes the
    earlier MQTT remote-link prototype (remote_ctrl_channel / src/remote/* /
    tool_remote_agent / cmd_channel), which remains available on the
    feat/remote-ctrl branch and in history.

    Highlights:
    - LLM watchdog timeout 60->120s, socket 120->180s (agent_config.h)
    - add notify_service and lvgl_toast
    - enhance mcp_client, audio_playback, voice_channel, volc_asr, lvgl_ui

